## Manuscript

The manuscript is not bundled in this GitHub repository.

The separately published preprint:

“When Correct Answers Carry Invalid State: Evaluating Explicit State
Carriers in Stateful LLM Agents”

by Jiangwei Xue, Zhida Qin, and Yuda Bi is available at:

https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22720976

The author-owned manuscript material in that Zenodo record is licensed
under CC BY 4.0 according to the license attached to that record. That
license does not automatically apply to the complete GitHub repository.

